WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.106 --> 00:00:15.368
and Mandy stared at the scary creature.

2
00:00:15.388 --> 00:00:20.369
"This is Master Masamune's private room," snapped Haruki.

3
00:00:20.389 --> 00:00:22.710
"What is that?"

4
00:00:23.170 --> 00:00:23.970
Vinnie pointed.

5
00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:27.731
"It's his armor," said Haruki.

6
00:00:28.931 --> 00:00:32.640
The helmet was made of iron, and it had a scary mask.

7
00:00:33.901 --> 00:00:36.021
A big curved moon was on top.

8
00:00:36.041 --> 00:00:39.682
"Do samurai wear that all the time?"

9
00:00:40.022 --> 00:00:40.663
asked Vinnie.

10
00:00:40.683 --> 00:00:46.104
"Samurai only wear their armor during battle," explained Haruki.

11
00:00:46.124 --> 00:00:49.305
"But we always carry our swords."

12
00:00:50.665 --> 00:00:52.806
Haruki showed the children his sword.

13
00:00:52.826 --> 00:00:56.907
"Now follow me," he said, walking away quickly.

14
00:00:56.927 --> 00:01:01.713
"Please go slower," Mandy cried.

15
00:01:01.733 --> 00:01:05.056
"I can only take small steps."

16
00:01:06.337 --> 00:01:07.758
Haruki slowed down.

17
00:01:09.039 --> 00:01:12.201
His kimono was not tight around the legs like Mandy's.

18
00:01:12.221 --> 00:01:15.824
"Why is my kimono so tight?"

19
00:01:16.425 --> 00:01:17.265
Mandy asked.

20
00:01:17.285 --> 00:01:23.691
"The kimono trains women not to step too fast or too far," explained Haruki.

21
00:01:24.932 --> 00:01:27.313
Haruki slid open a door to a room.

22
00:01:27.333 --> 00:01:32.201
"Stay here until I return," he said, closing the door.

23
00:01:33.742 --> 00:01:36.564
Mandy admired a hanging scroll on the wall.

24
00:01:37.685 --> 00:01:39.586
Vinnie played with the sliding door.

25
00:01:39.606 --> 00:01:46.431
"I wish we had doors like this at home," he remarked, opening the door wide.

26
00:01:47.792 --> 00:01:50.794
Outside, three men walked by in silence.

27
00:01:52.315 --> 00:01:56.198
They walked to another house and crawled through a small door.

28
00:01:56.218 --> 00:01:59.520
"I'll bet they're samurai too!"

29
00:02:00.124 --> 00:02:01.485
said Vinnie, excited.

30
00:02:01.505 --> 00:02:04.407
"Let's see what's going on."

31
00:02:08.490 --> 00:02:15.055
to enter is a sign of respect," said one samurai, as the children crawled through the door too.

32
00:02:16.316 --> 00:02:20.479
In the room, the samurai were sitting very still on straw mats.

33
00:02:21.799 --> 00:02:25.462
There was a space beside one of the samurai close to the door.

34
00:02:25.482 --> 00:02:29.957
"Let's sit there," whispered Vinnie, pointing.

35
00:02:31.238 --> 00:02:35.261
A man greeted everyone, and the samurai bowed to the floor.

36
00:02:36.822 --> 00:02:41.346
Then the man took a cloth and began slowly wiping a small teacup.

37
00:02:41.366 --> 00:02:46.710
"It looks like he's going to serve tea," said Mandy.

38
00:02:46.730 --> 00:02:54.876
"It sure takes a long time," said Vinnie, yawning.

39
00:02:56.272 --> 00:02:58.693
The man cleaned each teacup and spoon.

40
00:03:00.113 --> 00:03:03.674
Next he opened a small bowl and took some tea from it.

41
00:03:05.195 --> 00:03:07.295
Then he put the tea into a cup.

42
00:03:07.775 --> 00:03:10.196
His movements were graceful and slow.

43
00:03:10.216 --> 00:03:14.757
"My legs hurt," complained Vinnie.

44
00:03:15.978 --> 00:03:20.279
He stretched his leg and accidentally kicked the samurai next to him.

45
00:03:21.719 --> 00:03:23.700
The samurai did not even notice.

46
00:03:25.072 --> 00:03:28.675
The man serving the tea now poured water into the cup.

47
00:03:29.996 --> 00:03:31.837
Then he quickly stirred the tea.

48
00:03:32.978 --> 00:03:34.999
Vinnie began to massage his legs.

49
00:03:36.340 --> 00:03:39.002
Another samurai gave Vinnie a stern look.

50
00:03:39.022 --> 00:03:43.665
"Be still, Vinnie," whispered Mandy.

51
00:03:43.685 --> 00:03:48.128
"Let's get out of here," said Vinnie.

52
00:03:49.269 --> 00:03:53.672
He quietly slid the small door open and Mandy crawled out.

53
00:03:55.004 --> 00:03:58.689
When it was Vinnie's turn, his kimono got stuck in the door.

54
00:03:58.709 --> 00:04:02.074
"Help!" he cried.

55
00:04:03.416 --> 00:04:05.599
Everyone in the room turned and stared.

56
00:04:07.061 --> 00:04:12.148
Smiling nervously, Mandy pulled her brother free and slid the door shut.
